<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Night Globe</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Conjurer (guild level 25, up to 80%), Sorcerer (guild level 25, up to 50%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast night globe</a>
</pre>
<p>Creates an orb of darkness out of your mana. Hold it (see <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>) or 
put it down, and it sucks the light out of the place around it: it darkens 
as much as two sun globes light up. Use it to hide in the dark, or to take 
the light from those who rely on it. Carried in your inventory, it does 
nothing.
</p><p>While you carry it, it lasts. Once it lies on the ground, it winks out of 
existence within five minutes, and the light returns. You must be standing, 
and you can't cast it while fighting. The spell is also found on staffs, 
scrolls and wands. For light instead, see <a cmd='#'>Help Sun Globe</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sun Globe</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Darkness</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>